<title>UK: Perpetual names Yerbury CIO.</title>
<headline>Perpetual names Yerbury CIO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Perpetual Plc on Friday said it had appointed Robert Yerbury to the new position of chief investment officer.</p>
<p>He will be responsible for all operational aspects of the investment department, it said. Yerbury has been a main board director since 1985.</p>
<p>He will take up his position as soon as a new head of the American investment department has been appointed.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
